The TM01 is a small battery-powered travel router and 8MB/32MB RT5350F Wifi/LAN/USB host that can take power from MicroUSB as well as from a built-in rechargeable battery that can charge other devices via USB. 

Under OpenWRT, the TM01 can e.g. serve as a small portable battery-powered media player (running e.g. [[https://github.com/mikebrady/shairport-sync|shairport-sync]]) that can directly drive and charge USB speakers with built-in USB sound card such as e.g. the Edifier MP260, or e.g. a car stereo (via a USB DAC).

